  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p>Traveling responsibly in Zanzibar means supporting local communities and protecting the environment:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Choose licensed operators:</strong> Ensure your tour guide holds a valid Zanzibar tourism license</li>
        <li><strong>Respect marine life:</strong> Don't touch coral, feed fish, or remove shells from beaches</li>
        <li><strong>Support local businesses:</strong> Stay in locally-owned accommodations, eat at local restaurants</li>
        <li><strong>Cultural sensitivity:</strong> Ask permission before photographing people, dress modestly when visiting villages</li>
        <li><strong>Conservation:</strong> Participate in beach clean-ups and conservation initiatives</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Dhow Coast Travels is committed to responsible tourism practices. All our tours follow ethical guidelines and support local communities.</p>
    </div>
